    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "确实，靠<R=相互保证毁灭,MAD>维持的和平始终伴随着事故风险。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=相互保证毁灭,MAD>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 83,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "要是因为机器故障之类的原因让世界毁灭，那可受不了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 75,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "话虽如此，多亏了核威慑，从那以后再也没有爆发世界大战。世界不是变得和平多了吗。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 117,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_ADDS_1945_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "不过，这和我们无缘。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 30,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "虽说核武器开发竞赛、太空开发竞赛这些被称为冷战，但既然没有武力冲突，反倒该说世界是和平的吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 138,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "战争并没有消失。看看朝鲜战争和越南战争就知道了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "话是这么说，不过这只是相对而言。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 48,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "而且，要是战争被彻底根除，我们也会很头疼。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 63,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "……我们可不是战争贩子。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 36,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "但话又说回来，我们也无法活在一个和平的世界里。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 69,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "是这么回事，不过……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 30,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    }
  ]
